<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Starwood Lodging raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Starwood Lodging raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex Brown said it upgraded Starwood Lodging Corp to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/8 to 46-1/8.</p>
</text>
